5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm so excited to play with you all! Let's try our best to find the werewolf together and be honest with each other!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"...Hello. I'll do my best, but I'm not very good at these things. I hope we can all get along.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's keep this professional. Since we have no data yet, the most logical approach is to observe everyone's speech patterns and reactions for contradictions.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,What a lovely group of people. Let us be patient and kind to one another as we figure this out. I am looking forward to our conversation.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Shizue. Let's maintain a harmonious atmosphere. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help the village.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, you're so serious! But I think that's helpful. Does anyone have a specific plan for how we should talk today?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't really have a plan. I'll just listen to what everyone else says.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,My plan is simple: identify who is trying too hard to appear innocent or who is mirroring others to blend in.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds very thorough, Asuka dear. Though I believe a warm heart can often reveal the truth just as well as a sharp mind.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think a balance of both is best. We can be kind while still staying vigilant. @Daisuke, don't be too nervous; we're all here together.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Midori, thank you for being so sweet to Daisuke! I'll be watching everyone with a big smile, but I'll keep my eyes open for the wolf!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Thanks, Midori... I appreciate it. I'll try to speak up more if I notice anything strange.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Emotional support is fine, but let's not let it cloud our judgment. The werewolf will likely use kindness as a shield.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Perhaps, but kindness is also our greatest strength. If we trust each other, the wolf will find it harder to divide us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"That's a wonderful way to put it, Shizue. I'll try to listen to everyone's sincerity.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I think we're all on the same page! Let's have a good night's sleep and see what happens tomorrow. Goodnight everyone!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Goodnight...,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I shall be analyzing today's dialogue tonight. Goodnight.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,Sweet dreams to you all. May you wake up feeling refreshed and peaceful.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,Goodnight everyone! I hope we all stay safe tonight.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
