31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Good morning! I hope everyone slept well! I have some very important information to share with you all...,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"...Good morning. Yumi, you sound really excited. Did you find something?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"If the Seer is among us and has a result, now is the most efficient time to share it before the werewolf can act.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, dear children. I wonder if our Seer has found a clue to guide us? Please, share only if you feel safe.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning! I'm curious too. @Yumi, are you the Seer? If you are, please tell us what you found!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Yes, I'm the Seer! And I'm so sorry to say this, but I divined Asuka last night, and she is the werewolf!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,...What? Asuka? I can't believe it. She seemed so... logical.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"That is a bold claim. By revealing yourself so early, Yumi, you've made yourself a target. I am a villager; Yumi is lying to frame me.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my, this is quite a shock. It is heartbreaking to think there is a wolf among us. @Yumi, are you absolutely sure?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"This is a very difficult start. If Yumi is the Seer, we found the wolf immediately! But if Asuka is telling the truth, Yumi is the wolf.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm 100% sure! I'm the Seer, and the result was clear. Asuka is the werewolf! Please, we have to vote for her!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know who to believe. Asuka doesn't seem like she'd lie, but Yumi is usually so honest...","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Think logically. A werewolf claiming to be the Seer is the oldest trick in the book. Yumi is attempting to eliminate me in one turn.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is so sad to see you two disagreeing. I want to believe both of you, but we must make a choice for the village.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, what do you think? Yumi's energy is usually very sincere, but Asuka's logic is hard to ignore.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Please trust me! I really want us to win! Asuka is the wolf, I promise!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll trust Yumi... she seems more genuine. I'm voting for Asuka.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,A mistake of emotion over evidence. You will regret this when the real wolf attacks tonight.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I shall trust Yumi's vision. It is a heavy heart that I cast my vote.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm with Yumi too. Her honesty is usually very bright. I'm voting for Asuka.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
